[en.DECISION_C12_EEL_UPGRADE_RADAR]
Reset Radar

[en.DECISION_C12_EEL_UPGRADE_RADAR_desc]
With the research conducted by some top scientists, our radar technology has made a breakthrough. Additionally, the miniaturization of devices, coupled with government propaganda, can effectively reduce the concerns of the masses.

[zh.DECISION_C12_EEL_UPGRADE_RADAR]
重新调试雷达

[zh.DECISION_C12_EEL_UPGRADE_RADAR_desc]
在一些顶尖科学家的研究下，我们的雷达技术取得了突破，同时小型化的装置搭配政府的宣传可以很好的降低群众们的顾虑。
